# Local deploy + offline-live-KV secrets. Copy to .env.deploy and fill in — NEVER commit.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN: Pages deploy + KV read/write token (Cloudflare dashboard).
# CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID: the Cloudflare account id.
# GV_KV_NS: the KV namespace id the worker's overlay data lives in.
# REVIEW_SITE_URL / REVIEW_EXPORT_KEY: `npm run review` — read/moderate comment threads.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY: optional — powers the Project Builder's /__ai/summarize route
#   (drop a doc → AI summary + drafting signals). Absent → route 503s, prototype
#   falls back to its local heuristic. For the DEPLOYED site set it as a Cloudflare
#   Pages env var/secret named ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, not here.
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=
GV_KV_NS=
REVIEW_SITE_URL=https://your-project.pages.dev
REVIEW_EXPORT_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
